INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (191,1,'2021-03-16 00:00:00','2021-03-16 00:00:00','Ringingroom users be aware that you can now get as many automatic helpers as you like. Robo-ringers are available courtesy of the excellent Wheatley.\n<br>   \n<br>It must be enabled in \'Tower settings\' before it will be visible. You can only enable it on towers that your account created.\n<br>\n<br>You can contact Robert the webmaster for help if RR\'s online help doesn\'t get you going.','Ringingroom now has automatic helpers - Wheatley has been embedded','','trash','open','open','','ringingroom-now-has-automatic-helpers-wheatley-has-been-embedded__trashed','','','2024-10-13 17:50:09','2024-10-13 17:50:09','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringingroom-now-has-automatic-helpers-wheatley-has-been-embedded/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (192,1,'2021-03-15 00:00:00','2021-03-15 00:00:00','<br>Every HCACR tower should have received a request to fill in an online questionnaire about ringing during the pandemic and looking to the future of ringing in your tower. There are 13 multiple choice questions, and it should take approximately 5-10 minutes to complete.\n<br>\n<br>Your responses will provide the association with an overview of ringing in the county and help us plan how we can best support you in the return to ringing.\n<br>\n<br>If you have not received details of the questionnaire, please contact your district secretary or Stuart Brant','Ringing recovery questionnaire to all towers','','trash','open','open','','ringing-recovery-questionnaire-to-all-towers__trashed','','','2024-10-13 17:50:09','2024-10-13 17:50:09','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringing-recovery-questionnaire-to-all-towers/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (193,1,'2020-10-05 00:00:00','2020-10-05 00:00:00','The Stevenage bells are back in action. Ringing had been suspended due to the 2019/2020 restoration of the church.\n<br>COVID restrictions to ringing remain.','Stevenage bells back in action','','trash','open','open','','stevenage-bells-back-in-action__trashed','','','2024-10-13 17:50:09','2024-10-13 17:50:09','',0,'http://hcacr.local/stevenage-bells-back-in-action/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (194,1,'2020-08-31 00:00:00','2020-08-31 00:00:00','HCACR Good news!\n<br>\n<br>The HCACR 200-Club was instigated in 1986 when the original number of subscribers was 100, the subscription was an annual £10, and total prizes of £500 were given out. Since then we have doubled the number of subscribers, doubled the number of prizes and doubled the amount transferred to the Bell Restoration Fund. In the intervening 34 years the value of the prizes has unfortunately become less impressive and the £1000 contribution to the BRF has devalued over the years. The current £10 sub, adjusted for inflation, would be about £29 in today’s money.  \n<br>\n<br>At the 2020 Annual General Meeting, held via Zoom on 29 August, it was agreed that it was essential to raise more money for the BRF to enable it to continue to make significant awards for bell restoration projects. Following a vote, the meeting agreed to double the 200-club sub to £20, with prizes also being doubled, with effect from 1 January 2021.  Monthly prizes will increase to two of £50. The prizes for the draw at the AGM will be two of £300, and two of £200 at the Kimpton Cup draw. The contribution to the BRF will increase to £2000, enabling more significant awards for bell restoration projects.\n<br>\n<br>This of course means that we have to ask you to double your subscription from January 2021. If you have a standing order, please change it as soon as possible to £20 (other details, including the account name of \"100 club\", remain the same). If in the past you have paid by cash or cheque it would be a huge help if you could set up a standing order to save administration work and costs. Contact David for bank details. \n<br>\n<br>Please ensure you put your name and 200-club number as a reference if you\'re setting up a new order.\nNew subscribers need to contact the administrator to get a number, currently just a few available. (<script>m2(\"dgambling\",\"gmail\",0,\"\",\"email David\")</script>)\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for your current and continued support.','100-club doubling of price and prizes - change your standing orders now','','trash','open','open','','100-club-doubling-of-price-and-prizes-change-your-standing-orders-now__trashed','','','2024-10-13 17:50:09','2024-10-13 17:50:09','',0,'http://hcacr.local/100-club-doubling-of-price-and-prizes-change-your-standing-orders-now/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (195,1,'2020-08-14 00:00:00','2020-08-14 00:00:00','AGM to be held via zoom on 29th August 4:30pm. Agenda available here.','AGM to be held Saturday 29th August 4:30pm via zoom, agenda posted','','trash','open','open','','agm-to-be-held-saturday-29th-august-430pm-via-zoom-agenda-posted__trashed','','','2024-10-13 17:50:09','2024-10-13 17:50:09','',0,'http://hcacr.local/agm-to-be-held-saturday-29th-august-430pm-via-zoom-agenda-posted/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (196,1,'2020-07-11 00:00:00','2020-07-11 00:00:00','The CCCBR guidance has been updated and seems to indicate that ringing can restart as of today. Feedback from Public Health England (PHE) has been incorporated in the notes. Final signoff by PHE has not yet been done, so further changes in guidance may occur.\n   <br>\n<br>The FAQs on that page continue to be very useful.','Ringing restart permitted from tomorrow (12th July) - Public Health England consultation started, but continues','','trash','open','open','','ringing-restart-permitted-from-tomorrow-12th-july-public-health-england-consultation-started-but-continues__trashed','','','2024-10-13 17:50:09','2024-10-13 17:50:09','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringing-restart-permitted-from-tomorrow-12th-july-public-health-england-consultation-started-but-continues/',0,'post','',0);
