INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (353,1,'2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','Please be advised that, owing to a major renovation of the church, all ringing at St Nicholas, Stevenage is suspended until Spring 2020 with immediate effect.','All ringing at St Nicholas, Stevenage temporarily suspended','','inherit','closed','closed','','220-revision-v1','','','2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','',220,'http://hcacr.local/?p=353',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (354,1,'2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','The HCACR AGM was held on 27th April 2019. Amongst other matters, a new president was elected for 2019-2020, the Bishop\'s Stortford District\'s Claire May. All other officers from the previous year were re-elected. \n<br><br>\n  Also announced at the AGM: the Kimpton cup is to be held at Hertingfordbury on Sat 28 September. The Coburn Trophy is to be held at Hemel\nHempstead on Sat 29 June.','AGM held; Claire May elected president for 2019/2020','','inherit','closed','closed','','221-revision-v1','','','2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','',221,'http://hcacr.local/?p=354',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (355,1,'2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','Following the devastating fire at the Notre-Dame cathedral in Paris on 15th April, the Archbishops of Canterbury & York and Prime Minister Theresa May asked for bells at churches and cathedrals across the UK to ring out in solidarity on Thursday 18th April (Maundy Thursday). Ringing in the week before Easter is usually prohibited, but many towers in Hertfordshire got agreement from their vicar and got bands together at short notice, or tolled the tenor for 7 minutes at 7pm to show their support. (CCCBR link now removed from its site, for archive purposes it was https://cccbr.org.uk/2019/04/16/ringing-for-notre-dame-call-to-action/)','Ringing for Notre Dame - the bells of Hertfordshire rang out on Maundy Thursday 18th April','','inherit','closed','closed','','222-revision-v1','','','2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','',222,'http://hcacr.local/?p=355',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (356,1,'2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','The Northern district have posted their programme for 2019 and updated the list of officers to reflect the last ADM.','Northern district annual programme posted','','inherit','closed','closed','','224-revision-v1','','','2024-10-13 17:50:13','2024-10-13 17:50:13','',224,'http://hcacr.local/?p=356',0,'revision','',0);
