INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (458,1,'2021-03-16 00:00:00','2021-03-16 00:00:00','Ringingroom users be aware that you can now get as many automatic helpers as you like. Robo-ringers are available courtesy of the excellent Wheatley.\n<br>   \n<br>It must be enabled in \'Tower settings\' before it will be visible. You can only enable it on towers that your account created.\n<br>\n<br>You can contact Robert the webmaster for help if RR\'s online help doesn\'t get you going.','Ringingroom now has automatic helpers - Wheatley has been embedded','','publish','closed','open','','ringingroom-now-has-automatic-helpers-wheatley-has-been-embedded','','','2021-03-16 00:00:00','2021-03-16 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringingroom-now-has-automatic-helpers-wheatley-has-been-embedded/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (459,1,'2021-03-15 00:00:00','2021-03-15 00:00:00','<br>Every HCACR tower should have received a request to fill in an online questionnaire about ringing during the pandemic and looking to the future of ringing in your tower. There are 13 multiple choice questions, and it should take approximately 5-10 minutes to complete.\n<br>\n<br>Your responses will provide the association with an overview of ringing in the county and help us plan how we can best support you in the return to ringing.\n<br>\n<br>If you have not received details of the questionnaire, please contact your district secretary or Stuart Brant','Ringing recovery questionnaire to all towers','','publish','closed','open','','ringing-recovery-questionnaire-to-all-towers','','','2021-03-15 00:00:00','2021-03-15 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringing-recovery-questionnaire-to-all-towers/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (460,1,'2020-10-05 00:00:00','2020-10-05 00:00:00','The Stevenage bells are back in action. Ringing had been suspended due to the 2019/2020 restoration of the church.\n<br>COVID restrictions to ringing remain.','Stevenage bells back in action','','publish','closed','open','','stevenage-bells-back-in-action','','','2020-10-05 00:00:00','2020-10-05 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/stevenage-bells-back-in-action/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (461,1,'2020-08-31 00:00:00','2020-08-31 00:00:00','HCACR Good news!\n<br>\n<br>The HCACR 200-Club was instigated in 1986 when the original number of subscribers was 100, the subscription was an annual £10, and total prizes of £500 were given out. Since then we have doubled the number of subscribers, doubled the number of prizes and doubled the amount transferred to the Bell Restoration Fund. In the intervening 34 years the value of the prizes has unfortunately become less impressive and the £1000 contribution to the BRF has devalued over the years. The current £10 sub, adjusted for inflation, would be about £29 in today’s money.  \n<br>\n<br>At the 2020 Annual General Meeting, held via Zoom on 29 August, it was agreed that it was essential to raise more money for the BRF to enable it to continue to make significant awards for bell restoration projects. Following a vote, the meeting agreed to double the 200-club sub to £20, with prizes also being doubled, with effect from 1 January 2021.  Monthly prizes will increase to two of £50. The prizes for the draw at the AGM will be two of £300, and two of £200 at the Kimpton Cup draw. The contribution to the BRF will increase to £2000, enabling more significant awards for bell restoration projects.\n<br>\n<br>This of course means that we have to ask you to double your subscription from January 2021. If you have a standing order, please change it as soon as possible to £20 (other details, including the account name of \"100 club\", remain the same). If in the past you have paid by cash or cheque it would be a huge help if you could set up a standing order to save administration work and costs. Contact David for bank details. \n<br>\n<br>Please ensure you put your name and 200-club number as a reference if you\'re setting up a new order.\nNew subscribers need to contact the administrator to get a number, currently just a few available. (<script>m2(\"dgambling\",\"gmail\",0,\"\",\"email David\")</script>)\n<br>\n<br>Thank you for your current and continued support.','100-club doubling of price and prizes - change your standing orders now','','publish','closed','open','','100-club-doubling-of-price-and-prizes-change-your-standing-orders-now','','','2020-08-31 00:00:00','2020-08-31 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/100-club-doubling-of-price-and-prizes-change-your-standing-orders-now/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (462,1,'2020-08-14 00:00:00','2020-08-14 00:00:00','AGM to be held via zoom on 29th August 4:30pm. Agenda available here.','AGM to be held Saturday 29th August 4:30pm via zoom, agenda posted','','publish','closed','open','','agm-to-be-held-saturday-29th-august-430pm-via-zoom-agenda-posted','','','2020-08-14 00:00:00','2020-08-14 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/agm-to-be-held-saturday-29th-august-430pm-via-zoom-agenda-posted/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (463,1,'2020-07-11 00:00:00','2020-07-11 00:00:00','The CCCBR guidance has been updated and seems to indicate that ringing can restart as of today. Feedback from Public Health England (PHE) has been incorporated in the notes. Final signoff by PHE has not yet been done, so further changes in guidance may occur.\n   <br>\n<br>The FAQs on that page continue to be very useful.','Ringing restart permitted from tomorrow (12th July) - Public Health England consultation started, but continues','','publish','closed','open','','ringing-restart-permitted-from-tomorrow-12th-july-public-health-england-consultation-started-but-continues','','','2020-07-11 00:00:00','2020-07-11 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringing-restart-permitted-from-tomorrow-12th-july-public-health-england-consultation-started-but-continues/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (464,1,'2020-07-01 00:00:00','2020-07-01 00:00:00','Today the Church of England updated its guidance to allow ringing to resume from Saturday 4th July - with significant preparation, limitations & guidelines noted in this document, a risk assessment, and as always, with the permission of the incumbent.\n<br>\n<br>While this is not a return to normality, and some towers will not be able to find a safe way to resume, many members will welcome being able to ring again at all.','Church of England permits limited return to ringing from Saturday 4th July','','publish','closed','open','','church-of-england-permits-limited-return-to-ringing-from-saturday-4th-july','','','2020-07-01 00:00:00','2020-07-01 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/church-of-england-permits-limited-return-to-ringing-from-saturday-4th-july/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (465,1,'2020-05-30 00:00:00','2020-05-30 00:00:00','BBC News article on what ringers are doing in lockdown.','Ringingroom.com features on BBC news!','','publish','closed','open','','ringingroom-com-features-on-bbc-news','','','2020-05-30 00:00:00','2020-05-30 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/ringingroom-com-features-on-bbc-news/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (466,1,'2020-03-20 00:00:00','2020-03-20 00:00:00','The committee have decided that due to Coronavirus (COVID-19), the forthcoming AGM will have to be postponed until later on in the year. The new date will depend on how the virus is contained.\n\n<br><br>In the meantime. please keep safe and see you all again after the restrictions have been lifted.','2020 HCACR AGM postponed due to Coronavirus','','publish','closed','open','','2020-hcacr-agm-postponed-due-to-coronavirus','','','2020-03-20 00:00:00','2020-03-20 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/2020-hcacr-agm-postponed-due-to-coronavirus/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (467,1,'2020-03-20 00:00:00','2020-03-20 00:00:00','Sophisticated scammers are emailing HCACR members using details from this website e.g. quoting Chris Hoare as treasurer and asking for emergency payments. Be extremely suspicious. If an email comes from a different address from usual, assume it may be phishing. If you think something might be legitimate, use details you already have in your phonebook to ask for confirmation before acting. Never click links in emails.','Scam alert: Scammers are emailing HCACR members using details from the website','','publish','closed','open','','scam-alert-scammers-are-emailing-hcacr-members-using-details-from-the-website','','','2020-03-20 00:00:00','2020-03-20 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/scam-alert-scammers-are-emailing-hcacr-members-using-details-from-the-website/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (468,1,'2020-03-19 00:00:00','2020-03-19 00:00:00','Please be aware that a lot of ringing activities in Hertfordshire have been suspended, or heavily curtailed. Please confirm the ringing is happening before travelling. Practice & service times on this website do not reflect the COVID-19 pattern unless they specifically say so.','Hertfordshire ringing widely suspended or curtailed - check before travelling','','publish','closed','open','','hertfordshire-ringing-widely-suspended-or-curtailed-check-before-travelling','','','2020-03-19 00:00:00','2020-03-19 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/hertfordshire-ringing-widely-suspended-or-curtailed-check-before-travelling/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (469,1,'2020-03-17 00:00:00','2020-03-17 00:00:00','The CCCBR have issued new guidance on Coronavirus (COVID-19). Please read the full article. As ever, all churches and bands are free to take their own approach.','CCCBR advises cancelling ringing activities due to Coronavirus (COVID-19)','','publish','closed','open','','cccbr-advises-cancelling-ringing-activities-due-to-coronavirus-covid-19','','','2020-03-17 00:00:00','2020-03-17 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/cccbr-advises-cancelling-ringing-activities-due-to-coronavirus-covid-19/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (470,1,'2020-01-28 00:00:00','2020-01-28 00:00:00','Why not take up bellringing as part of your county\'s year of culture? New people always welcome, aged 7 to 127. Why not find your local ringing church on this website and get in touch?\n  <br><a href=\"https://cccbr.org.uk/bellringing/what-is-bell-ringing/\">What is bellringing?</a>\n  <br>Note: HCACR has no formal affiliation with Hertfordshire Year of Culture.','Hertfordshire Year of Culture 2020 - why not take up bellringing as a new sport and hobby?!','','publish','closed','open','','hertfordshire-year-of-culture-2020-why-not-take-up-bellringing-as-a-new-sport-and-hobby','','','2020-01-28 00:00:00','2020-01-28 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/hertfordshire-year-of-culture-2020-why-not-take-up-bellringing-as-a-new-sport-and-hobby/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (471,1,'2019-12-15 00:00:00','2019-12-15 00:00:00','Congratulations to the band at Cottered for scoring the first quarter peal on the newly-augmented 6 - a seasonally suitable \"Xmas Tree Delight Minor\"!\n  <br><img src=\"images/20191215-Cottered news.jpg\" width=400 height=300>','Cottered first QP on 6 - Xmas Tree Delight Minor','','publish','closed','open','','cottered-first-qp-on-6-xmas-tree-delight-minor','','','2019-12-15 00:00:00','2019-12-15 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/cottered-first-qp-on-6-xmas-tree-delight-minor/',0,'post','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (472,1,'2019-10-27 00:00:00','2019-10-27 00:00:00','You can now raise money for Hertfordshire Bell Restoration via smile.amazon.co.uk at no cost to yourself. This is a new approach as Amazon left easyfundraising on 5th August 2019.','Amazon users: raise money for HCACR for free via smile.amazon.co.uk','','publish','closed','open','','amazon-users-raise-money-for-hcacr-for-free-via-smile-amazon-co-uk','','','2019-10-27 00:00:00','2019-10-27 00:00:00','',0,'http://hcacr.local/amazon-users-raise-money-for-hcacr-for-free-via-smile-amazon-co-uk/',0,'post','',0);
