INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5013,1,'2024-10-24 14:03:50','2024-10-24 14:03:50','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are nine towers with ringable bells in the Watford District, all of which have active members of the association. There is regular Sunday Service ringing at most towers, and all but one have a regular practice night. The annual District Programme includes visits to most ringable towers in the District. On the first Saturday in the month we normally have a Ringing Meeting, with special methods of varying complexity. An outing replaces the August meeting and a six bell district striking competition for the Christopher Wooley Trophy is held in March or April. Ringers of all abilities will receive a warm welcome at our monthly meetings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[wptabs id=\"5004\"]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Watford District','','inherit','closed','closed','','95-revision-v1','','','2024-10-24 14:03:50','2024-10-24 14:03:50','',95,'http://hcacr.local/?p=5013',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5014,1,'2024-10-24 14:04:11','2024-10-24 14:04:11','<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>There are nine towers with ringable bells in the Watford District, all of which have active members of the association. There is regular Sunday Service ringing at most towers, and all but one have a regular practice night. The annual District Programme includes visits to most ringable towers in the District. On the first Saturday in the month we normally have a Ringing Meeting, with special methods of varying complexity. An outing replaces the August meeting and a six bell district striking competition for the Christopher Wooley Trophy is held in March or April. Ringers of all abilities will receive a warm welcome at our monthly meetings.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[wptabs id=\"5004\"]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Watford District','','inherit','closed','closed','','95-revision-v1','','','2024-10-24 14:04:11','2024-10-24 14:04:11','',95,'http://hcacr.local/?p=5014',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5015,1,'2024-10-24 14:05:04','2024-10-24 14:05:04','<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The current membership of the District is approximately 105 ringers. It is our aim to visit each of the fifteen towers at least once per year. Our annual programme typically includes the Hayden Cup Six-Bell Striking Competition, the Richard Atkins Memorial call change competition, the Annual District Quiz, a District Outing and a Carol Service, traditionally held jointly with the Eastern District of Hertford County Association of Change Ringers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[wptabs id=\"5004\"]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Bishop\'s Stortford District','','inherit','closed','closed','','91-revision-v1','','','2024-10-24 14:05:04','2024-10-24 14:05:04','',91,'http://hcacr.local/?p=5015',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5017,1,'2024-10-24 14:05:28','2024-10-24 14:05:28','<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Eastern District extends along the A10 from Cheshunt in the south to Westmill and Aspenden in the north. It includes Northaw, Hertingfordbury, Tewin and Datchworth in the west and Hunsdon in the east, a total of 18 towers with about 95 Association members. There are nine 6 bell towers, eight 8 bell, and one 10 bell tower. A District ringing meeting every second Saturday in the month with a programme of events including learners\' practices, evening meetings, and District quarter peals. There is also four 10 bell meetings a year held at All Saints Hertford. It is the aim of the District committee to visit each of the towers in the District at least once a year. A six-bell striking competition, the Boden Shield is held annually at a different tower each year, the winning teams representing the District in the Association competition, the Kimpton Cup.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[wptabs id=\"5004\"]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Eastern District','','inherit','closed','closed','','87-revision-v1','','','2024-10-24 14:05:28','2024-10-24 14:05:28','',87,'http://hcacr.local/?p=5017',0,'revision','',0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` VALUES (5018,1,'2024-10-24 14:05:49','2024-10-24 14:05:49','<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The St Albans District embraces 20 towers, centred around the four ringing towers in St Albans but stretching to Essendon in the East, Barnet in the South and Kings Walden in the North. We are an active District striving to support towers\' efforts in training learners. There are monthly meetings on each third Saturday either in the morning or the evening, of which two also encompass a traditional ringers\' tea. Social events are also arranged according to the likely support expected. All ringers are very welcome at St Albans District meetings. If you are a newcomer to ringing and live in the St. Albans area please call the District Secretary for details of your nearest tower and who to contact.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>[wptabs id=\"5004\"]</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','St. Albans District','','inherit','closed','closed','','93-revision-v1','','','2024-10-24 14:05:49','2024-10-24 14:05:49','',93,'http://hcacr.local/?p=5018',0,'revision','',0);
